# =====================================================================
# .gitignore for curso-power-v2026.2
#
# Keep in the repo:
#   - All .qmd source files (slides + handouts + exercises + Part 0 primer)
#   - All rendered HANDOUT and EXERCISE HTMLs (self-contained,
#     embed-resources: true, so they need no _files/ sidecar)
#   - The slides/ folder (PowerPoint + PDF of the conceptual deck)
#   - data/, img/, custom.css, README.md, _simulations_final.Rproj
#
# Ignore everything else.
# =====================================================================

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Rendered RevealJS slide decks (10 files matching the course parts)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# These depend on their *_files/ sidecars to render. Since we ignore
# the sidecars below, the slide HTMLs would be broken anyway.
# Participants who want the RevealJS slides should `quarto render` the
# .qmd source locally. The conceptual PPTX/PDF deck in slides/ is the
# primary slide deliverable.
scripts/1. Introduction and between-subject design.html
scripts/1.2 Between-subjects design and linear modeling.html
scripts/2. Within-subject design and linear modeling.html
scripts/3. Repeated measures.html
scripts/4. By-participant adjustments to the slope.html
scripts/5. Correlated slopes and intercepts.html
scripts/6. By-item varying intercepts.html
scripts/7. Modeling reaction time data.html
scripts/8. Power analysis across varying sample sizes and effect sizes.html
scripts/9. Recap.html

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Quarto sidecar folders (libs, figures generated at render time)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Handouts are self-contained, so they don't need these.
# Slide-deck _files/ are needed at runtime but the slide HTMLs are
# excluded above, so the sidecars are dead weight too.
*_files/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Quarto cache
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
.quarto/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Helper scripts and folders that are not for participants
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
render_all.sh
_archive/
scripts/demos/
scripts/visualizations/
output/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Exercise 1 solutions (not yet shared with students)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Remove these two lines when you are ready to publish the worked answers.
scripts/Exercise_1_Power_Simulation_Between_Subjects_solutions.qmd
scripts/Exercise_1_Power_Simulation_Between_Subjects_solutions.html

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# RStudio / IDE
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
.Rproj.user/
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# macOS / Linux / editor junk
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*~
*.swp
*.swo
.vscode/
.idea/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Office lock files (appear while a .pptx/.docx/.xlsx is open)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
~$*
